From energy conservation,
$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{1}{2} k x^2 & =\frac{1}{2}(4 k) y^2 \\
\frac{y}{x} & =\frac{1}{2}
\end{aligned}
$$
$\therefore$ correct option is (c).

$$
\begin{aligned}
& F_{\text {net }}=-\left(\frac{4 k}{3}\right) \cdot x \\
